    {
      "id": "guide",
      "kind": "notes",
      "content": {
        "type": "notes",
        "text": "FRAME SCENE \u00b7 EVOLVING VOICE\nTidal Functions scans four authored scenes.\nScene1 controls volume; Scene2 opens the ladder.\nClick a stored tick to select its stable ID.\nDrag a lane point or its large LEVEL knob.\nDrag the top tick to move the stored timestamp.\nFRAME is the configured offset; LIVE is measured.\nCURVES changes easing and channel response.\nMCP edit_frame_scene uses the same undo/history.\nRequires the Frame Scene development build."
      }
    },
    {
